## Definition Of Ready

- Title is clear.
- Goal and scope are bounded.
- Out of scope is explicit.
- Affected docs, code, config, tests, content, rules, assets, and data are identified.
- Acceptance criteria are reviewable.
- Verification plan names real commands or states `not configured`.
- Risks and open questions are recorded.
- Approval record is pending or filled before implementation.

## Definition Of Done

- Approved scope is implemented.
- No unrelated changes are included.
- Relevant docs/templates are updated.
- Relevant tests are added or updated.
- Relevant rules, content, assets, or playtest notes are updated.
- Verification was run or limitations are documented.
- Remaining risks or follow-up items are recorded.

